{"strongs": "H5337", "word": "נָצַל", "translit": "na.tsal", "root": "נצח", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "strip, plunder", "definition": "[ נָצַל 212 verb not in Qal; Pi`el strip, plunder ; Niph`al deliver oneself, be delivered ; Hiph`il snatch away, deliver (Ecclus Hiph`il Participle מצלת delivering (Levi conjectures יציל Eccl 40:24 a)); Late Hebrew Hiph`il = Biblical Hebrew; Biblical Aramaic Haph`el id. ; Syriac pour out ; Arabic intransitive tincturam exuit emisitque barba, ex cuspide excidit sagitta, etc., Kam Frey ; Ethiopic III. evulsum or abruptum excidere e suo loco , Di 698 ); — Niph`al Perfect 1 plural נִצַּלְנוּ Jer 7:10 Imperfect יִנָּצֵל Deut 23:16 , + 1 singular אִנָָּֽצְלָה Ps 69:15 , + 8 t. Imperfect; Infinitive הַנָּצֵל Isa 20:6 + 3 t. — 1. reflexive tear oneself away, deliver oneself: absolute Prov 6:3 ; Ezek 14:16 ; Ezek 14:18 ; 2Kgs 19:11 = Isa 37:11 with מִיַּד Prov 6:5 מֵעִ ֗֗֗ אֶל escape from-unto Deut 23:16 . 2. passive, be torn, out or away מִפִּי הָאֲרִי Amos 3:12 be delivered , absolute Gen 32:31 ; Jer 7:10 ; Ps 33:16 ; Mic 4:30 מִפְּנֵי Isa 20:6 מִכַּף Hab 2:9 מִן Ps 69:15 . Pi`el Perfect 2 masculine plural נִצַּלְתֶּם Exod 3:22 Imperfect יְנַצֵּל Ezek 14:14 + 2 t.; — 1. strip of, spoil , absolute 2Chr 20:25 with accusative of person Exod 3:22 ; Exod 12:36 ( J ). 2. deliver , with accusative נַפְשָׁם Ezek 14:14 . Hiph`il 190 Perfect הִצִּיל Exod 12:27 2 masculine singular הִצַּ֫לְתָּ Exod 5:23 + 50 t. Perfect; Imperfect יַּצִּיל 2Kgs 17:39 יַצֵּל Gen 31:9 + 63 t. Imperfect; Imperative הַצֵּל Prov 24:11 הַצִּ֫ילָה Ps 22:21 suffix הַצִּילֵנִי Gen 32:12 + 24 t. Imperative; Infinitive absolute הַצֵּל 2Kgs 18:30 + 4 t.; construct הַצִּיל Gen 37:22 + 23 t. Infinitive; Participle מַצִּיל Deut 32:39 + 16 t. Participle — 1. take away, snatch away , e.g. property Gen 31:9 ; Gen 31:10 ( E ) Hos 2:11 , prey from the mouth of animals 1Sam 17:35 ; Amos 3:12 ; Ezek 34:10 , words of ׳ י from the mouth Ps 119:43 וְאֵין מַצִּיל בֵּינֵיהֶם 2Sam 14:6 and there was none to tear them apart (two fighting); עֵינֵנוּ וְהִצִּיל 2Sam 20:6 and take away our eye (elude our sight, Ges ; Ew We after ᵐ5 cast shadow over our eye, denominative from צֵל Bö Th after ᵑ6 tear away our eye, harm us irretrievably, see Dr 18 26. 2 .; HPS escape from us [ מִמֶּנּוּ , as ᵐ5 L ], compare Bu [ וְנִצַּל ]). 2. rescue, recover, e.g. cities Judg 11:26 wives and property 1Sam 30:8 ; 1Sam 30:18 ; 1Sam 30:22 . 3. deliver from: \\ \\ a. enemies and troubles , absolute 1Sam 12:21 ; Prov 19:19 ; Isa 50:2 ; Jer 39:17 אֵין מַצִּיל Judg 18:28 ; Job 5:4 ; Job 10:7 ; Ps 7:3 ; Ps 50:22 ; Ps 71:11 ; Isa 5:29 ; Isa 42:22 ; Isa 43:13 ; Hos 5:14 ; Mic 5:7 with accusative Gen 18:8 ( E ), Exod 5:23 ; Exod 12:27 ( J ), Deut 23:15 + 39 t.; הַצִּיל נַפְשׁוֺ Isa 44:20 ; Isa 47:14 ; Ezek 3:19 ; Ezek 3:21 ; Ezek 14:20 ; Ezek 33:19 with מִן from Mic 5:6 + 25 t.; מִיַּד from the hand or power of Gen 32:12 ; Exod 2:19 ( J ) + 57 t.; מִתַּחַת יַד Exod 18:10 ( E ); מִכַּף 2Sam 14:16 ; 2Sam 19:10 ; 2Sam 22:1 = Ps 18:1 , 2Kgs 20:6 = Isa 38:6 ; 2Chr 32:11 ; Ezra 8:31 . \\ \\ b. from death Prov 11:16 ; Prov 12:6 מִמּוֺת Josh 2:13 ( J ), Ps 33:19 ; Ps 56:14 ; Prov 10:12 = Prov 11:4 מִשְּׁאוֺל Ps 86:13 ; Prov 23:14 . 4. deliver from sin and guilt (in late writings), מִכָּלפְּֿשָׁעַי Ps 39:9 from all my trangression ; מִדָּמִים Ps 51:6 from bloodguiltiness ; הַצִּילֵנוּ וְכַפֵּר עַלחַֿטּאֹתֵינוּ Ps 79:9 deliver us and cover over all our sins ; probably also כְּאִמְרָֽתְךָ הַצִּילֵנִי Ps 119:170 . Hoph`al Participle מֻצּל ; — כְּאוּד מֻצָּל מִשְּׂרֵטָה Amos 4:11 as a brand plucked out of the burning ; מֵאֵשׁ Zech 3:2 from the fire. Hithpa`el וַיִּתְנַצְּלוּ אֶתעֶֿדְיָם Exod 33:6 ( E ) and they stripped themselves of their ornaments.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5336')\">BDB5336</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5337')\">H5337</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5335')\">BDB5335</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5337')\">BDB5337</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>נָצַל</bdbheb><sub>212</sub> <b>verb</b> not in <b>Qal; Pi`el</b> <highlightword>strip, plunder</highlightword>; <b>Niph`al</b> <highlightword>deliver oneself, be delivered</highlightword>; <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlightword>snatch away, deliver</highlightword> (Ecclus Hiph`il Participle <bdbheb>מצלת</bdbheb> <highlight>delivering</highlight> <wrongReferenceRemoved/> (Levi conjectures <bdbheb>יציל</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Eccl 40:24\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(21,40,24)\">Eccl 40:24</ref>a)); Late Hebrew Hiph`il = Biblical Hebrew; Biblical Aramaic Haph`el <highlight>id.</highlight>; Syriac <placeholder3407/> <highlight>pour out</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder3408/> intransitive <highlight>tincturam exuit emisitque</highlight> barba, ex cuspide <highlight>excidit</highlight> sagitta, etc., <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kam')\">Kam</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Frey')\">Frey</lookup>; Ethiopic III. <placeholder3409/> <highlight>evulsum</highlight> or <highlight>abruptum excidere e suo loco</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup>698</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 1 plural <bdbheb>נִצַּלְנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 7:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,10)\">Jer 7:10</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִנָּצֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,16)\">Deut 23:16</ref>, + 1 singular <bdbheb>אִנָָּֽצְלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,15)\">Ps 69:15</ref>, + 8 t. Imperfect; <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>הַנָּצֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 20:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,20,6)\">Isa 20:6</ref> + 3 t. — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> reflexive <highlight>tear oneself away, deliver oneself:</highlight> absolute <ref ref=\"Prov 6:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,3)\">Prov 6:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 14:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,14,16)\">Ezek 14:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 14:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,14,18)\">Ezek 14:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,11)\">2Kgs 19:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 37:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,11)\">Isa 37:11</ref> with <bdbheb>מִיַּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,5)\">Prov 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעִ ֗֗֗ אֶל</bdbheb> <highlight>escape from-unto</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,16)\">Deut 23:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> passive, <highlight>be torn, out or away</highlight> <bdbheb>מִפִּי הָאֲרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 3:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,12)\">Amos 3:12</ref> <highlight>be delivered</highlight>, absolute <ref ref=\"Gen 32:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,31)\">Gen 32:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,10)\">Jer 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 33:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,16)\">Ps 33:16</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Mic 4:30\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,30)\">Mic 4:30</ref> <bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 20:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,20,6)\">Isa 20:6</ref> <bdbheb>מִכַּף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 2:9\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,9)\">Hab 2:9</ref> <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,15)\">Ps 69:15</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p> <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>נִצַּלְתֶּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,22)\">Exod 3:22</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יְנַצֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 14:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,14,14)\">Ezek 14:14</ref> + 2 t.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>strip of, spoil</highlight>, absolute <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,25)\">2Chr 20:25</ref> with accusative of person <ref ref=\"Exod 3:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,22)\">Exod 3:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 12:36\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,36)\">Exod 12:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>deliver</highlight>, with accusative <bdbheb>נַפְשָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 14:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,14,14)\">Ezek 14:14</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p><b>Hiph`il</b><sub>190</sub> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>הִצִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 12:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,27)\">Exod 12:27</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִצַּ֫לְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 5:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,23)\">Exod 5:23</ref> + 50 t. Perfect; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַּצִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:39\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,39)\">2Kgs 17:39</ref> <bdbheb>יַצֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,9)\">Gen 31:9</ref> + 63 t. Imperfect; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הַצֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 24:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,11)\">Prov 24:11</ref> <bdbheb>הַצִּ֫ילָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,21)\">Ps 22:21</ref> suffix <bdbheb>הַצִּילֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,12)\">Gen 32:12</ref> + 24 t. Imperative; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַצֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:30\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,30)\">2Kgs 18:30</ref> + 4 t.; <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַצִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 37:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,22)\">Gen 37:22</ref> + 23 t. Infinitive; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַצִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:39\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,39)\">Deut 32:39</ref> + 16 t. Participle — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>take away, snatch away</highlight>, e.g. property <ref ref=\"Gen 31:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,9)\">Gen 31:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,10)\">Gen 31:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Hos 2:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,11)\">Hos 2:11</ref>, prey from the mouth of animals <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:35\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,35)\">1Sam 17:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 3:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,12)\">Amos 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,10)\">Ezek 34:10</ref>, words of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> from the mouth <ref ref=\"Ps 119:43\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,43)\">Ps 119:43</ref> <bdbheb>וְאֵין מַצִּיל בֵּינֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,6)\">2Sam 14:6</ref> <highlight>and there was none to tear them apart</highlight> (two fighting); <bdbheb>עֵינֵנוּ וְהִצִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,6)\">2Sam 20:6</ref> <highlight>and take away our eye</highlight> (elude our sight, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>cast shadow</highlight> over our eye, denominative from <bdbheb>צֵל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bö')\">Bö</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>tear away</highlight> our eye, harm us irretrievably, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>18 26. 2</sup></lookup>.; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup> <highlight>escape from us</highlight> [<bdbheb>מִמֶּנּוּ</bdbheb>, as <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup>], compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> [<bdbheb>וְנִצַּל</bdbheb>]). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> rescue, recover, <highlight>e.g.</highlight> cities <ref ref=\"Judg 11:26\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,26)\">Judg 11:26</ref> wives and property <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,8)\">1Sam 30:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,18)\">1Sam 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,22)\">1Sam 30:22</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>deliver from:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>enemies and troubles</highlight>, absolute <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,21)\">1Sam 12:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 19:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,19)\">Prov 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 50:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,50,2)\">Isa 50:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 39:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,17)\">Jer 39:17</ref> <bdbheb>אֵין מַצִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 18:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,28)\">Judg 18:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 5:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,4)\">Job 5:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 10:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,7)\">Job 10:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 7:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,7,3)\">Ps 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,22)\">Ps 50:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1