light> <ref ref=\"Prov 11:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,16)\">Prov 11:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,6)\">Prov 12:6</ref> <bdbheb>מִמּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 2:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,13)\">Josh 2:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ps 33:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,19)\">Ps 33:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 56:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,56,14)\">Ps 56:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 10:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,12)\">Prov 10:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"Prov 11:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,4)\">Prov 11:4</ref> <bdbheb>מִשְּׁאוֺל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 86:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"86\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"86\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,86,13)\">Ps 86:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 23:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,14)\">Prov 23:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>deliver from sin and guilt</highlight> (in late writings), <bdbheb>מִכָּלפְּֿשָׁעַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 39:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,9)\">Ps 39:9</ref> <highlight>from all my trangression</highlight>; <bdbheb>מִדָּמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,6)\">Ps 51:6</ref> <highlight>from bloodguiltiness</highlight>; <bdbheb>הַצִּילֵנוּ וְכַפֵּר עַלחַֿטּאֹתֵינוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 79:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,9)\">Ps 79:9</ref> <highlight>deliver us and cover over all our sins</highlight>; probably